 - `pair_correction_profile`
 - `pair_correction_radius`
 - `pair_correction_strength`
 - `pair_correction_cutoff_multiplier`
+- `pair_correction_base_strength`
+- `pair_correction_strength_scaling`
 - `repulsion_softening_radius`
